# 统一换行符：仓库内文本一律 LF，Windows 脚本保持 CRLF
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件（避免 diff/换行转换）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.apk binary
*.jks binary
